<title>RUSSIA: FIGURE SKATING-BAILEYS CUP OF RUSSIA FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>FIGURE SKATING-BAILEYS CUP OF RUSSIA FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ST PETERSBURG, Russia 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final results on</p>
<p>Saturday of the Baileys Cup of Russia figure skating</p>
<p>competition, the sixth and the last qualifying event of the ISU</p>
<p>Champions Series:</p>
<p>Men, final results:</p>
<p> 1. Alexei Urmanov (Russia)			    1.5</p>
<p> 2. Alexei Yagudin (Russia)			    3.0</p>
<p> 3. Michael Weiss (U.S.)				 4.5</p>
<p> 4. Evgeny Pluschenko (Russia)			 7.5</p>
<p> 5. Naoki Shigematsu (Japan)			   8.0</p>
<p> 6. Jeff Langdon (Canada)			     10.0</p>
<p> 7. Daniel Hollander (U.S.)			   10.0</p>
<p> 8. Steven Cousins (Britain)			  10.5</p>
<p> 9. Andrei Vlaschenko (Germany)		     13.0</p>
<p> 10.Thierry Ceres (France)			    15.5</p>
<p> 11.Szabolcs Vidrai (Hungary)			 16.0</p>
<p>Retired: Michael Tyllesen (Denmark)</p>
<p>Women's final result:</p>
<p> 1. Irina Slutskaya (Russia)			   2.5</p>
<p> 2. Julia Lautova (Austria)			    4.0</p>
